  <launchable type="desktop-id">trackrs.desktop</launchable>
  <description>
    <p>
      TrackRS is a single-player 3D rally racing game with vehicle physics, varied terrain and weather, and co-driver pace notes. This demo package features the Ahead map. The game code is licensed under GNU GPL version 2 or later; bundled game data may have separate licenses and attributions. See the installed copyright and credits documentation before redistributing.
    </p>
